      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "帝都の南のダダ平原を根城にしている\n“ベイル血殲衆”って一味が残忍な連中でね。\nその連中と血まみれの戦いを繰り広げてきなよ。\n仲間になる話はそうしたらまた考えてあげる。",
        "official_en": "The Bale Lacerators are a brutal bunch situated in\nthe Dada Plains south of the capital. Go and bleed\n'em for me. Then I'll think about joining you.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
